## Step 4: 🕒 Recent Trades Page

Here's the complete Streamlit code snippet for your Recent Trades analytics page:

```python
import streamlit as st
import pandas as pd

# Placeholder Data (replace with real data retrieval)
recent_trades = pd.DataFrame({
    "Time": ["10:15", "10:45", "11:00", "11:30", "12:00"],
    "Bot": ["Bot A", "Bot B", "Bot C", "Bot A", "Bot D"],
    "Horse": ["Lightning", "Thunder", "Storm", "Rain", "Sunshine"],
    "Profit/Loss (£)": [25, -15, 35, 50, -20],
    "Outcome": ["Win", "Loss", "Win", "Win", "Loss"]
})

# Page Title
st.title("🕒 Recent Trades")

# Recent Trades Table
st.subheader("Latest Trades Overview")
st.dataframe(recent_trades, use_container_width=True)

# Trades Performance Breakdown
st.subheader("Trades Performance Breakdown")
performance_summary = recent_trades.groupby("Outcome").size().reset_index(name='Counts')
st.bar_chart(performance_summary.set_index("Outcome"))
```

